        "instructions": [
          {
            "id": 152866,
            "primary_message": "If using wooden skewers, place 12-16 skewers in a shallow dish of water to soak until you are ready to use them. ",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152867,
            "primary_message": "If using salmon with skin, place the fillet, skin-side down, on a cutting board. Holding the tail end firmly, use a knife to cut between the flesh and skin; continue to cut through the length of the fillet (take care not to cut through the skin); discard the skin. If you don’t have a tail end, start at one corner of the fillet and work your way in until the knife is between the skin and flesh. ",
            "secondary_message": "1 ½ lb salmon fillet"
          },
          {
            "id": 152868,
            "primary_message": "Cut the salmon crosswise into 1-inch strips and transfer to a medium bowl; season with oil, salt, and pepper. Set aside. ",
            "secondary_message": "2 tsp extra virgin olive oil\n½ tsp salt\n½ tsp black pepper"
          },
          {
            "id": 152869,
            "primary_message": "Heat a grill pan, outdoor grill, or skillet over medium-high heat.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152870,
            "primary_message": "Wash and dry the fresh produce.",
            "secondary_message": "2 pints grape tomatoes\n4 peaches\n1 small pkg fresh basil"
          },
          {
            "id": 152871,
            "primary_message": "Drizzle oil over both sides of the bread. Once the grill is hot, add bread and grill until charred marks appear, 2-4 minutes per side. Transfer to a plate and set aside to cool. (Leave the grill on for the salmon.). Work in batches if necessary. ",
            "secondary_message": "2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n8 slices whole grain bread"
          },
          {
            "id": 152872,
            "primary_message": "Meanwhile, peel and thinly slice the shallots; add to a large bowl.",
            "secondary_message": "2 shallots"
          },
          {
            "id": 152873,
            "primary_message": "Add vinegar, oil, salt, and pepper to the bowl with the shallots; stir together.",
            "secondary_message": "¼ cup red wine vinegar\n2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n½ tsp salt\n¼ tsp black pepper"
          },
          {
            "id": 152874,
            "primary_message": "Thread 1 strip of salmon onto each skewer and place on a plate. Alternatively, you can cook the salmon directly on the grill/skillet without using skewers. ",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152875,
            "primary_message": "Coat the grill or skillet with oil; place kabobs on the grill, rotating every 1½-2 minutes, until salmon is opaque and cooked through, 6-8 minutes. Transfer to a plate and loosely cover with foil. Work in batches if necessary. ",
            "secondary_message": "4 tsp extra virgin olive oil"
          },
          {
            "id": 152876,
            "primary_message": "Meanwhile, tear the bread into bite-sized pieces. Halve the tomatoes and add both to the bowl with the shallots. ",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152877,
            "primary_message": "Halve peaches, twist to open, and remove pits. Slice each half into wedges and add to the bowl with the tomatoes and bread.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152878,
            "primary_message": "Pick the basil leaves off the stems; discard the stems and slice the leaves into a chiffonade by stacking them and rolling tightly into a cigar, then slicing crosswise into thin ribbons. Add to the salad bowl and toss to combine.",
            "secondary_message": null
          },
          {
            "id": 152879,
            "primary_message": "To serve, divide salmon kabobs and panzanella salad between dishes. Enjoy! ",
            "secondary_message": null
          }
        ],
